              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isirayiri yonna bwe yawulira okusalawo kwa kabaka, ne beewuunya kabaka, kubanga baalaba ng'alina amagezi okuva eri Katonda okulamula ensonga.",
          "type": "text",
